From b503cdccd8d14b99b570ca477ccea87e63df3c64 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Evan Almloff <evanalmloff@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 8 Jun 2026 09:54:50 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] Exclude unsupported wry upstream test signatures

Carries the full remaining tests/wasm delta on top of the ESM
conversion patch: signature exclusions for wry, the rest of the
CommonJS-to-ESM companion conversions, and rustfmt normalization
of the suite.
